    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38872" root="ملح" body-key="m">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلَحٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُلْحَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A certain disease and fault
in the kind leg of a beast of carriage;</i> (TA;) <i>a
swelling in the hock,</i> or <i>hock-tendon,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُرْقُوب</span>,) <i>of
a horse;</i> (S, K;) <i>less than what is called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرَذٌ</span>;
which is a name given to it when it has become
violent. (S.)

